Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:10.05,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Phone Etiquette
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.29,0:00:12.37,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Rapid Response
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:17.86,Default,说话人B,0,0,0,,Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.09,0:00:20.29,Default,说话人B,0,0,0,,Mehood Lestie Hotel, Wuhan HK Central Flagship Store.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.57,0:00:21.44,Default,说话人B,0,0,0,,This is Susie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.63,0:00:22.72,Default,说话人B,0,0,0,,How may I assist you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:25.16,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,1. Answer within 3 rings:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.47,0:00:26.97,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Answer before the third ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:31.16,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Greet with "Good morning/afternoon/evening" based on the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.77,0:00:36.11,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,2. Identify yourself:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.37,0:00:37.49,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,State the hotel name, department, and your name clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.89,0:00:38.51,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Example:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.79,0:00:40.93,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, Mehood Lestie Hotel,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.25,0:00:44.21,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Wuhan HK Central Flagship Store front desk,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.55,0:00:45.51,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,this is Xiao Xi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:47.93,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Effective Communication & Listening
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.14,0:00:49.30,Default,说话人B,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.59,0:00:52.98,Default,说话人B,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.33,0:00:55.31,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,1. Listen attentively:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.78,0:00:56.90,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Focus on the guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.43,0:00:58.73,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Let guests finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.82,0:01:01.24,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Use verbal cues to show you are listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.45,0:01:02.92,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,2. Never interrupt:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.38,0:01:07.07,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Wait for the guest to finish speaking before responding, no matter how urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.47,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Show respect and professionalism.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.47,0:01:12.17,Default,说话人B,0,0,0,,Mr. Wallace, if I may confirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.69,0:01:14.22,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,3. Repeat to confirm:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.85,0:01:17.89,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Before ending the call, repeat key details
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.31,0:01:21.98,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,, (room number, time, requests)to ensure zero errors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.58,0:01:26.18,Default,说话人B,0,0,0,,So I have you down for a non-smoking king room tomorrow, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.74,0:01:27.87,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,End with courtesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.11,0:01:29.17,Default,说话人B,0,0,0,,Alright, Mr. Wallace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.73,0:01:31.19,Default,说话人B,0,0,0,,Your reservation is all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.41,0:01:32.72,Default,说话人B,0,0,0,,Anything else I can help with?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.51,0:01:35.95,Default,说话人B,0,0,0,,My pleasure, Mr. Wallace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.22,0:01:37.17,Default,说话人B,0,0,0,,Thank you for calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.69,0:01:39.13,Default,说话人B,0,0,0,,See you soon. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:41.94,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,1. Guest hangs up first:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.29,0:01:45.95,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Wait for the guest to end the call before gently replacing the receiver.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.11,0:01:47.07,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Sign of respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.42,0:01:49.55,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,2. Use "Please" and "Thank You":
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.91,0:01:52.02,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Always lead with "Please" for respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:54.39,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,and end with "Thank you" for appreciation,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.74,0:01:56.71,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,example: "Thank you for calling."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.97,0:01:58.69,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Summary and review.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.93,0:02:00.76,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Answer: Within 3 rings & identify yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.87,0:02:01.93,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Listen: Focus without interruptions
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.69,0:02:06.09,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,and confirm details
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.16,0:02:09.05,Default,说话人A,0,0,0,,Hang up: Guest first & replace gently.
